2.Click on it and your ganna seee shirt graphic, shirt and pants
3.Click On The Shirt And see it&apos;s link Copy It
4.Then go to the Morph and it&apos;ll say shirt paste the link on the shirt be aware there are 2 morphs &apos;&apos;Morph 1 and Morph 2&apos;&apos;
Post the link on Both of the Shirts on Morph 1 and 2
5.Do the same with the pants
6.Rename THe Morph tO whatever you want it too be
7.REMBER TO HAVE THE CLOTHES YOU WANT ON THE MORPH&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; YOU MUST BE WEARING THEM!
8. If You Have Any Question Please pm ShadowLighting
9. ENJOY!</ProtectedString>
